  planner_response {
    response: "I have built and successfully compiled the **MedsAlarm** Android application according to your requirements.\n\n### Completed Features:\n1. **Splash Screen**:\n   - Features the app logo, title **\"MedsAlarm\"**, and subtitle **\"Medication Reminders Made Simple\"**.\n   - Displays for ~3 seconds before smoothly transitioning to the home screen.\n2. **Home Screen (Material 3)**:\n   - **Pinned Top App Bar**: Displays the app icon, title, subtitle, and live date/time (`Today is <Day>, <MMMM dd, yyyy> | hh:mm:ss AM/PM`) compressed compactly in one line with Material 3 dynamic color styling.\n   - **Alarm List**: Scrollable list of today\'s active medications showing medicine name, frequency, status counts (\"X Done, Y Pending\"), live countdown timers (`HH:MM:SS`), and a **\"Take\"** button.\n   - **Dynamic States**: When all daily doses are completed, the card background turns light green and displays a green **\"Done\"** label. Statuses automatically reset daily.\n   - **Floating Action Button**: Prominent `+` FAB anchored at the bottom-right.\n3. **Add Alarm Form (\"+\")**:\n   - Text fields for Medicine Name, Dosage, and optional Instructions.\n   - Medication form selector for **Tablet, Capsule, and Injection**.\n   - Time Picker (Hour, Minute, AM/PM) for the first dose.\n   - 7-day repeat toggle buttons (`S M T W T F S`).\n   - Dose frequency selector (`1x`, `2x`, `3x`, `5x` a day) with automatic interval calculation.\n   - Notification options checkboxes (**Status Bar Notification**, **Sound Alarm**, **Vibrate Alarm**).\n   - **Set Button** to save and schedule alarms.\n4. **Alarm Scheduling & Native Notifications**:\n   - Uses native `AlarmManager.setExactAndAllowWhileIdle()` and `BroadcastReceiver` so alarms fire precisely even when the app is closed or the device is in Doze mode.\n   - Posts status bar notifications with sound and vibration via `NotificationCompat` and `NotificationChannel`.\n   - Declares all required permissions (`SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM`, `POST_NOTIFICATIONS`, `VIBRATE`, `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED`) in `AndroidManifest.xml`."
    thinking: "**Verifying Core Requirements**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the initial requirement for a native Android application built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose. All the core requests are being implemented as requested, so I\'m progressing with other functions.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built and successfully compiled the **MedsAlarm** Android application according to your requirements.\n\n### Completed Features:\n1. **Splash Screen**:\n   - Features the app logo, title **\"MedsAlarm\"**, and subtitle **\"Medication Reminders Made Simple\"**.\n   - Displays for ~3 seconds before smoothly transitioning to the home screen.\n2. **Home Screen (Material 3)**:\n   - **Pinned Top App Bar**: Displays the app icon, title, subtitle, and live date/time (`Today is <Day>, <MMMM dd, yyyy> | hh:mm:ss AM/PM`) compressed compactly in one line with Material 3 dynamic color styling.\n   - **Alarm List**: Scrollable list of today\'s active medications showing medicine name, frequency, status counts (\"X Done, Y Pending\"), live countdown timers (`HH:MM:SS`), and a **\"Take\"** button.\n   - **Dynamic States**: When all daily doses are completed, the card background turns light green and displays a green **\"Done\"** label. Statuses automatically reset daily.\n   - **Floating Action Button**: Prominent `+` FAB anchored at the bottom-right.\n3. **Add Alarm Form (\"+\")**:\n   - Text fields for Medicine Name, Dosage, and optional Instructions.\n   - Medication form selector for **Tablet, Capsule, and Injection**.\n   - Time Picker (Hour, Minute, AM/PM) for the first dose.\n   - 7-day repeat toggle buttons (`S M T W T F S`).\n   - Dose frequency selector (`1x`, `2x`, `3x`, `5x` a day) with automatic interval calculation.\n   - Notification options checkboxes (**Status Bar Notification**, **Sound Alarm**, **Vibrate Alarm**).\n   - **Set Button** to save and schedule alarms.\n4. **Alarm Scheduling & Native Notifications**:\n   - Uses native `AlarmManager.setExactAndAllowWhileIdle()` and `BroadcastReceiver` so alarms fire precisely even when the app is closed or the device is in Doze mode.\n   - Posts status bar notifications with sound and vibration via `NotificationCompat` and `NotificationChannel`.\n   - Declares all required permissions (`SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM`, `POST_NOTIFICATIONS`, `VIBRATE`, `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED`) in `AndroidManifest.xml`."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 868541580
    }
